cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this release, please cite it using these metadata."
type: software
title: "Prices, incomes, construction and rents in Portugal's housing market, 2008–2025: a reproducible descriptive assessment"
abstract: >-
  Pinned official statistics (INE, Eurostat, ECB), standard-library Python code, tests, figures and a research
  report on house prices, incomes, construction, population and rents in Portugal, its 9 NUTS 2 and 26 NUTS 3
  regions and 308 municipalities, 2008–2025. Every reported number is recomputed from checksummed source files.
  The release separates established descriptive findings, descriptive associations and unresolved causal
  hypotheses; none of its associations is causal.
